# Rendering And Cache Strategy

- Public marketing pages should default toward static generation or ISR unless they truly need per-request freshness.
- Session-dependent, tenant-dependent, or user-specific pages should use dynamic rendering.
- When using ISR, choose an explicit `revalidate` value instead of accidental defaults.
- Use `generateStaticParams` when a route can be precomputed safely.
- Use no-store or equivalent cache avoidance for sensitive or user-specific responses.
